  "solution": "Given equation: 3 × 9 - 4 ÷ 2 + 6 = 28\n\nAfter replacing the numbers, we get:\n\n1. 9 and 2\n\n__**3 × 2**__ - __**4 ÷ 9**__ + 6 = 28\n\n⇒ __**6**__ - 0.44 __**+ 6**__ = 28\n\n⇒ __**12**__**__ - 0.44__ **= 28\n\n⇒ 11.56 ≠ 28\n\n2. 6 and 4\n\n__**3 × 9**__ - __**6 ÷ 2**__ + 4 = 28\n\n⇒ __**27**__ - 3 __**+ 4**__ = 28\n\n⇒ __**31 - 3**__** **= 28\n\n⇒ 28 = 28\n\n3. 3 and 6\n\n__**6 × 9**__ - __**4 ÷ 2**__ + 3 = 28\n\n⇒ __**54**__ - 2 __**+ 3**__ = 28\n\n⇒ 57 - 2 = 28\n\n⇒ 55 ≠ 28\n\n4. 9 and 6\n\n__**3 × 6**__ - __**4 ÷ 2 **__+ 9 = 28\n\n⇒ __**18**__ - 2 __**+ 9**__ = 28\n\n⇒ 27 - 2 = 28\n\n⇒ 25 ≠ 28\n\nHence, '**6 and 4**' is the correct answer.",
